<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The number of outstanding
shares of each of the issuer&#8217;s classes of capital or common stock as of December 31, 2024 was: <span id="xdx_907_edei--EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding_iI_c20241231_zydoTycbOmci"><ix:nonFraction name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31" id="Fact000049" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">6,685,918,822</ix:nonFraction></span> Ordinary Shares</p>

