<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Indicate by check mark if
the registrant is a well-known seasoned issuer, as defined in Rule 405 of the Securities Act. Yes <span style="font-family: Wingdings">&#168;</span>
<span id="xdx_90E_edei--EntityWellKnownSeasonedIssuer_c20240101__20241231_zIN2NH8yuUXd"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-01-01to2024-12-31" id="Fact000050" name="dei:EntityWellKnownSeasonedIssuer">No</ix:nonNumeric></span> <span style="font-family: Wingdings">x</span></p>

