<td style="width: 0"/><td style="width: 45pt">(4)</td><td style="text-align: justify">Represents the aggregate fees billed for tax compliance, tax advice and tax consulting services.</td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

