<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span id="i16d"></span> <b>ITEM 16D.</b> <b>EXEMPTIONS FROM THE LISTING STANDARDS FOR AUDIT COMMITTEES.</b></p>



<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

