<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: bold 18pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0; color: #1F3A5D; text-transform: uppercase">Consolidated StatementS of Comprehensive
Income</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0; color: #1F3A5D">For the year ended 31 December</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="xdx_305_113_pn3n3_zIhi6hDox815" summary="xdx: Statement - CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF COMPREHENSIVE INCOME" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
