<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">All revenue came from the sale of services in 2023 and 2022. It is derived entirely
from the Group&#8217;s R&amp;D collaboration agreements. It is recognised over the contract term proportionate to the progress in overall
satisfaction of the performance obligations.&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

