</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AA_zkvcNWQT7C26" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">The Group&#8217;s R&amp;D collaboration agreements are the delivery of services within
the next 12 months for which the practical expedient in paragraph 121 (a) of IFRS15 applies.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">In 2024, no revenue from customers (2023: 1 customer; 2022: 1 customer).&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

