<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0">During the year no Directors (2023:0; 2022: 0) participated in a defined contribution
pension scheme. Pension contributions in the above note include those of the Chief Scientific Officer.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0">Emoluments disclosed above include the following amounts in respect of
the highest paid Director.</p>

