<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">As at 31 December the right of use asset consisted of
leasehold improvements of net book value &#163;<span id="xdx_904_eifrs-full--RightofuseAssets_iI_pn3p0_c20241231__ifrs-full--ClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis__ifrs-full--LeaseholdImprovementsMember_z0iwuo9Ch6v" title="Right of use asset"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:RightofuseAssets" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_ifrs-full_LeaseholdImprovementsMember" id="Fact001630" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="0" unitRef="GBP">215,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
(2023: &#163;<span id="xdx_907_eifrs-full--RightofuseAssets_iI_pn3p0_c20231231__ifrs-full--ClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis__ifrs-full--LeaseholdImprovementsMember_zt4qlorN7uHa" title="Right of use asset"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:RightofuseAssets" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31_ifrs-full_LeaseholdImprovementsMember" id="Fact001632" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="0" unitRef="GBP">350,000</ix:nonFraction></span>;
2022: &#163;<span id="xdx_902_eifrs-full--RightofuseAssets_iI_pn3p0_c20221231__ifrs-full--ClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis__ifrs-full--LeaseholdImprovementsMember_z8Ci5bfF68vd" title="Right of use asset"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:RightofuseAssets" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_ifrs-full_LeaseholdImprovementsMember" id="Fact001634" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="0" unitRef="GBP">485,000</ix:nonFraction></span>)
and laboratory equipment of net book value &#163;Nil <span id="xdx_900_eifrs-full--RightofuseAssets_c20241231__ifrs-full--ClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis__custom--LaboratoryEquipmentMember_pn3n3" title="Right of use asset" style="display: none"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:RightofuseAssets" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_custom_LaboratoryEquipmentMember" id="Fact001636" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="GBP">0</ix:nonFraction></span>
(2023: &#163;Nil <span id="xdx_903_eifrs-full--RightofuseAssets_c20231231__ifrs-full--ClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis__custom--LaboratoryEquipmentMember_pn3n3" title="Right of use asset" style="display: none"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:RightofuseAssets" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31_custom_LaboratoryEquipmentMember" id="Fact001638" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="GBP">0</ix:nonFraction></span>; 2022: &#163;<span id="xdx_90B_eifrs-full--RightofuseAssets_iI_pn3p0_c20221231__ifrs-full--ClassesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentAxis__custom--LaboratoryEquipmentMember_zPIy5hhrvMTe" title="Right of use asset"><ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:RightofuseAssets" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_custom_LaboratoryEquipmentMember" id="Fact001640" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="0" unitRef="GBP">2,000</ix:nonFraction></span>).</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">On 1 February 2023 laboratory equipment previously disclosed within
right of use assets was transferred to laboratory equipment when the final payment on the finance lease was made. On 1 January 2022 software
previously disclosed within computer equipment was transferred to intangible assets.</p>

