and cash equivalents and cash flow supporting notes</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: transparent">Cash and cash equivalents for purposes
of the consolidated statement of cash flows comprises:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

