<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: transparent">The provision as at 1 January 2022 represents
management&#8217;s best estimate of the &#8216;making good&#8217; clause on the Cardiff office which was vacated during the fourth quarter
of 2021. This liability was settled during 2022.</p>

