  </table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt"></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A3_zFPGgtRSRpe9" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: transparent">More details with regard to the line
items above are included in the respective notes:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
