<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_23B_z4x5clCVPLfc" style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: transparent">22&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Share
