<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: transparent">During the year the Company issued the
following warrants over ADSs, and these were recognised in the warrant reserve until exercise:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

