<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_23A_zFY60RoMqmN4" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p></ix:exclude>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: transparent">The following information is relevant
in the determination of the fair value of options granted during the year 2024 under the equity share based remuneration schemes operated
by the Group.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

