<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: transparent">The share price used in the determination
of the fair value of the options granted in 2024 was the share price on the date of grant.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
