<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_233_zzgsapJJbhVf" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p></ix:exclude>

<p style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: transparent">Warrants issued in lieu of fees</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: transparent">The Company issues warrants over ADSs
to certain its brokers in lieu of broker fees connected to the equity transactions in the year. The warrants are accounted for as share
based payments.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

