</tr></table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A8_z4emcoiY6aSb" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left; background-color: transparent">Number and original
price of warrants have been adjusted to reflect the ratio change of ADS&#8217;s to ordinary shares that occurred on 5 July 2023 and 4
October 2024.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman; margin: 0pt">&#160;</p>

